    "content": "<h2 id=\"%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%EF%BC%9A%E8%BF%9B%E5%85%A5%E7%BC%96%E8%BE%91\" tabindex=\"-1\">常用功能：进入编辑<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%EF%BC%9A%E8%BF%9B%E5%85%A5%E7%BC%96%E8%BE%91\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p><video src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202402/d57159d245f26c73e19b41a230dd84f8.mp4\" controls=\"controls\" class=\"my-video\" style=\"max-width:100%\">\n\n\n视频描述\n</video>\n<strong>路径</strong>：【首页】-【常用功能】-编辑图标</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202309/a8445c94c0ea548a41e6b09d97ff15da.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><strong>业务场景</strong>：</p>\n<p>在首页配置常用功能，快捷打开更方便。</p>\n<h2 id=\"%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%EF%BC%9A%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E\" tabindex=\"-1\">常用功能：新增<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%EF%BC%9A%E6%96%B0%E5%A2%9E\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p><strong>路径</strong>：【首页】-【常用功能】-编辑图标</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202309/1cd56a51cfd8f97eaeef8d55d9c76f15.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><strong>功能说明</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>常用功能最多可选择10个。</li>\n<li>编辑常用功能时，上方为已选定区域，下方为待选区域。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A0%E9%99%A4\" tabindex=\"-1\">常用功能：删除<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%A0%E9%99%A4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p><strong>路径</strong>：【首页】-【常用功能】-编辑图标-【-】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202105/b4832ade870640a88560c9685737e94c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%EF%BC%9A%E6%8E%92%E5%BA%8F\" tabindex=\"-1\">常用功能：排序<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%EF%BC%9A%E6%8E%92%E5%BA%8F\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p><strong>路径</strong>：【首页】-【常用功能】-编辑图标-拖拽文本框可调整顺序</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202312/99f218e25034c593a201755b69126de2.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><strong>功能说明</strong>：</p>\n<p>编辑常用功能时，在上方已选定区域内可自定义排序。</p>\n",
